From: Benjamin Larsson <benjamin.larsson@genexis.eu>
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: airoha: add EN7512/EN7521/EN7526 GPON/EPON SERDES PHY

Backport of the Airoha EN7512/EN7521/EN7526 GPON/EPON SERDES PHY platform
driver (xp_csr_phy_all, 32-bit MMIO via PBUS). GPON/EPON mode is selected
from the "pon-mode" DT property; TX/RX polarity from DT booleans. Relevant
to the EcoNet EN751221 XPON MAC/PHY. From linux-next commit 3e5650a2b2a5.

Signed-off-by: Benjamin Larsson <benjamin.larsson@genexis.eu>
diff --git a/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig b/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig
index a7ade7b95a2e..a1a7aa38e54e 100644
--- a/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig
@@ -470,3 +470,5 @@
 	  Ethernet physical media devices and the Gigabit Ethernet controller.
 
 endif # PHYLIB
+
+source "drivers/net/phy/airoha/Kconfig"
--- a/drivers/net/phy/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/Makefile
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@ obj-y				+= $(sfp-obj-y) $(sfp-obj-m)
 obj-$(CONFIG_ADIN_PHY)		+= adin.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_ADIN1100_PHY)	+= adin1100.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_AIR_EN8811H_PHY)   += air_en8811h.o
